<text>
<p>Period ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.13		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			  6,973		    5,635</p>
<p> Revs		     464,582		  389,189</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,173		    3,835</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q1 1996 results have been restated to reflect the change in FY 1997 from the equity to cost method of accounting for its investment in the HeereMac joint venture.</p>
